Objective: To lead in points by no later than turn 20

Planet: High impact
Clan: Musashi

Notes: The Axis has a fortress surrounded by water. Both sides have an Eco-Sphere but the Seven Knights has had one longer and has a higher rating. With the very limited resources that are available, you must find a way to destroy the enemy eco-sphere and achieve the objective.
 
Hints: Note that the Missile Crawler has only one missile and there is no way to reload your units. Also note that your single tank is an extremely powerful model with super enhancements. Make sure your plan uses each shot you get in an intelligent way. Don't waste ammo on secondary targets.

